  "goodToKnow": "Das Mikrofon (also spelled Mikrophon) is a microphone, often shortened to das Mikro. Online-meeting German: Du bist stummgeschaltet (you're on mute), Mach dein Mikro an! German companies such as Sennheiser and Neumann (whose U 47 is a studio classic) are world-famous for microphones. From Greek mikros (small) and phone (sound). Stressed on the last syllable. Plural: die Mikrofone."
